sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant T as enable_waiting task
  participant W as HogFlow writes
  T->>W: enable(flow)
  alt database error
    W--xT: error
    T->>T: retry with backoff
    Note over T,W: after the last retry: error log and metric, the flow stays waiting
    U->>W: Enable again
    W->>W: all senders verified, so save active
  else user turned the flow off meanwhile
    W->>W: lock row, status is draft
    W-->>T: skipped, no event
  end
